WEBVTT

STYLE
::cue(c.color9CD5FF) { color: #9CD5FF; }

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:07.000 line:5% align:center
<b><c.color9CD5FF>One Pace Addon</c></b>

2
00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:18.700
[SABO]
Ace, Luffy, listen!

3
00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:21.800
The three of us, we're
gonna leave this country.

4
00:00:21.800 --> 00:00:25.340
We're gonna sail the seas
and see the whole world.

5
00:00:26.910 --> 00:00:29.710
[ACE]
From now on, we're
honest to goodness brothers.

6
00:00:29.710 --> 00:00:32.050
Cheers to that!

7
00:00:32.050 --> 00:00:34.380
[LUFFY, ACE, SABO]
– Brothers!
– Brothers!

8
00:00:47.260 --> 00:00:48.790
[exhales]

9
00:00:48.790 --> 00:00:50.090
[LUFFY grunts]

10
00:00:53.130 --> 00:00:55.470
How long you gonna lay
there like a moron?

11
00:00:55.470 --> 00:00:58.140
[LUFFY whimpers]

12
00:00:58.140 --> 00:01:01.210
By the way, the treasure we were
keeping in the forest is gone.

13
00:01:01.210 --> 00:01:02.760
Someone must have gotten to it.

14
00:01:02.760 --> 00:01:06.420
Meh. I don't care about
the treasure, not anymore.

15
00:01:06.420 --> 00:01:09.720
I mean, those were pirate
savings I was sharing with Sabo,

16
00:01:09.720 --> 00:01:12.120
and you, too, later on, I guess.

17
00:01:12.120 --> 00:01:15.190
But in the end, he didn't
need money to set sail,

18
00:01:15.190 --> 00:01:17.490
so why should I get
bent out of shape about it?

19
00:01:17.490 --> 00:01:22.770
After all, what's the point in having
treasure if you can't even protect it?

20
00:01:22.770 --> 00:01:27.370
[LUFFY sniffs]
Hey, Ace, I...

21
00:01:28.640 --> 00:01:31.340
[LUFFY]
I wanna get stronger!

22
00:01:32.760 --> 00:01:38.340
[LUFFY]
Stronger and stronger
and stronger and stronger

23
00:01:38.340 --> 00:01:41.090
and stronger and stronger.

24
00:01:41.090 --> 00:01:42.960
Stronger and stronger.

25
00:01:42.960 --> 00:01:47.130
Stronger and stronger
and stronger and stronger!

26
00:01:47.130 --> 00:01:50.300
I wanna be the strongest in the world!

27
00:01:50.300 --> 00:01:53.470
And then, I'll protect everyone!

28
00:01:53.470 --> 00:01:56.270
I won't lose anyone I care about!

29
00:01:57.480 --> 00:01:59.950
[LUFFY]
You gotta make me a promise!

30
00:01:59.950 --> 00:02:01.980
I'm begging you.

31
00:02:01.980 --> 00:02:04.370
Please don't die, 'kay, Ace?

32
00:02:04.370 --> 00:02:06.110
Cut it out!

33
00:02:06.110 --> 00:02:08.980
You ought to be worried
about dying before I do!

34
00:02:08.980 --> 00:02:11.620
What, did you forget?
You're a lot weaker than me!

35
00:02:11.620 --> 00:02:14.020
Listen, and you listen up good!

36
00:02:14.980 --> 00:02:17.220
I'm never going to die!

37
00:02:22.140 --> 00:02:25.340
[ACE]
Ya know, Sabo told
me to take care of you,

38
00:02:25.340 --> 00:02:29.380
so I promise, I'm not
gonna die, okay? Not ever!

39
00:02:29.380 --> 00:02:33.480
At least not as long as I've got a wussy
little brother who needs me to protect him.

40
00:02:33.480 --> 00:02:35.850
Yeah, okay!

41
00:02:35.850 --> 00:02:38.250
Smarts aren't exactly my strong point,

42
00:02:38.250 --> 00:02:42.690
so I still don't really
understand why Sabo was killed.

43
00:02:42.690 --> 00:02:47.560
But whoever did it, they must be opposed
to freedom, because they shot him down

44
00:02:47.560 --> 00:02:49.760
before he ever got a taste of it.

45
00:02:51.030 --> 00:02:55.600
[ACE]
But we shared that same cup of saké
with him and we're still alive!

46
00:02:58.360 --> 00:03:01.060
Luffy, listen to me, okay?

47
00:03:01.060 --> 00:03:05.930
There's just one way to live
and that's without any regrets.

48
00:03:05.930 --> 00:03:07.430
[LUFFY grunts]

49
00:03:20.560 --> 00:03:22.800
[SABO]
Boys from families like mine,

50
00:03:22.800 --> 00:03:26.700
once they turn 18, they're
officially registered as nobles.

51
00:03:26.700 --> 00:03:27.910
[ACE]
Hm.

52
00:03:27.910 --> 00:03:31.540
That's why I'm leaving.
I gotta be gone before I'm 17.

53
00:03:34.180 --> 00:03:39.110
Someday, we're gonna
set sail, just like Sabo.

54
00:03:39.110 --> 00:03:43.480
We're gonna live the way we wanna
live, more free than anyone else.

55
00:03:43.480 --> 00:03:44.710
[LUFFY]
Mm.

56
00:03:46.420 --> 00:03:48.150
[ACE]
But you know what that means.

57
00:03:48.150 --> 00:03:50.720
We'll make plenty of
enemies along the way.

58
00:03:50.720 --> 00:03:53.620
We're gonna have to fight
Garp someday, I bet.

59
00:03:53.620 --> 00:03:55.990
We gotta be willing to risk everything.

60
00:03:55.990 --> 00:03:59.630
Let's go out to sea at 17,
just like Sabo planned.

61
00:03:59.630 --> 00:04:02.670
Then, we'll be pirates!

62
00:06:58.250 --> 00:07:00.680
[NARRATOR]
The World Noble's
visit to the Goa Kingdom

63
00:07:00.680 --> 00:07:05.150
has come and gone,
but another visitor lingers.

64
00:07:04.950 --> 00:07:11.690
<b>Will of the Winds</b>

65
00:07:05.150 --> 00:07:09.220
At a small village in the East Blue,
a group of aspiring swordsmen

66
00:07:09.220 --> 00:07:12.260
chat about the strange encounter.

67
00:07:12.290 --> 00:07:18.600
[thudding]

68
00:07:23.270 --> 00:07:26.110
Did you see that weird
guy with the big head?

69
00:07:26.110 --> 00:07:28.480
Yeah, his face was totally crazy, too!

70
00:07:28.480 --> 00:07:31.480
[STUDENT A]
I bet he needs that giant
ship to fit his giant head!

71
00:07:31.480 --> 00:07:35.820
580, 581,

72
00:07:35.820 --> 00:07:41.220
582, 583...

73
00:07:41.220 --> 00:07:44.030
...584... [grunts]

74
00:07:46.850 --> 00:07:48.980
[IVANKOV]
You certainly kept me waiting!

75
00:07:48.980 --> 00:07:52.180
What could possibly be
more important than me?

76
00:07:54.120 --> 00:07:55.020
Sorry.

77
00:07:55.020 --> 00:07:57.790
[gasps]
Goodness... is that?

78
00:07:57.790 --> 00:07:59.250
[REVOLUTIONARY B]
Someone get help!

79
00:07:59.250 --> 00:08:00.490
[REVOLUTIONARY C]
This doesn't look good.

80
00:08:00.490 --> 00:08:01.760
Let's prepare treatment!

81
00:08:01.760 --> 00:08:02.720
[REVOLUTIONARY D]
Roger!

82
00:08:02.720 --> 00:08:05.460
[REVOLUTIONARIES chattering]

83
00:08:05.460 --> 00:08:06.530
Honestly!

84
00:08:06.530 --> 00:08:09.560
What in the world have
you been up to all day?

85
00:08:09.560 --> 00:08:13.200
[DRAGON]
I was watching the ceremony
they held for the World Noble.

86
00:08:13.200 --> 00:08:14.940
[gasps]

87
00:08:14.940 --> 00:08:19.670
One, that's some risky business
and two, why didn't you take me?

88
00:08:19.670 --> 00:08:23.060
[DRAGON]
Because you would attract too
much attention, obviously.

89
00:08:23.060 --> 00:08:24.070
[gasps]

90
00:08:24.070 --> 00:08:26.230
[IVANKOV]
Could it be I'm too fabulous?

91
00:08:27.400 --> 00:08:29.940
[DRAGON]
At any rate,
we've tarried for long enough.

92
00:08:29.940 --> 00:08:32.270
We've got business to attend to.

93
00:08:33.660 --> 00:08:35.490
Do we have supplies?

94
00:08:35.490 --> 00:08:38.730
The training hall at the village
gave us just enough food for now.

95
00:08:38.730 --> 00:08:40.230
Very well.

96
00:08:41.530 --> 00:08:43.470
Set sail!

97
00:08:43.470 --> 00:08:45.970
We're heading back to Baltigo!

98
00:08:52.020 --> 00:08:55.850
[NARRATOR]
A short time later,
in the nearby Goa Kingdom...

99
00:09:01.260 --> 00:09:04.130
[MAN A]
Ah, finally, some junk!

100
00:09:05.930 --> 00:09:09.900
[NARRATOR]
Although the fire razed Gray Terminal
and its people to the ground,

101
00:09:12.430 --> 00:09:14.110
of scavengers appeared.

102
00:09:19.040 --> 00:09:20.980
[LUFFY]
You're in for it this time!

103
00:09:20.980 --> 00:09:22.610
Here it goes!

104
00:09:22.610 --> 00:09:25.580
Now, Gum-Gum...

105
00:09:25.580 --> 00:09:27.090
Pistol!

106
00:09:27.090 --> 00:09:28.290
[gasps]

107
00:09:32.690 --> 00:09:33.630
[LUFFY]
Heh.

108
00:09:35.130 --> 00:09:36.660
[yelps]

109
00:09:36.660 --> 00:09:38.840
- [gasps]
- [LUFFY grunting]

110
00:09:38.840 --> 00:09:41.410
[ACE laughing]

111
00:09:41.410 --> 00:09:42.670
Are you kidding me?

112
00:09:42.670 --> 00:09:44.310
You still suck butt!

113
00:09:46.940 --> 00:09:50.180
[ACE]
It doesn't matter how hard you
punch if you can't hit anything!

114
00:09:50.180 --> 00:09:52.450
I told you, rubber's a crappy power.

115
00:09:52.450 --> 00:09:54.290
It's no good for fighting!

116
00:09:56.220 --> 00:09:59.220
You're the dumb one!
I'm honest, that's all!

117
00:09:59.220 --> 00:10:03.240
I'm trying to save you from falling
on your stupid rubber ass all day!

118
00:10:03.240 --> 00:10:06.180
You're just jealous 'cause you
can't do awesome stuff like me!

119
00:10:06.180 --> 00:10:10.580
All you've got are jerk powers and I'm
working on all kinds of cool moves!

120
00:10:10.580 --> 00:10:12.890
Luffy! That was great!

121
00:10:12.890 --> 00:10:16.970
Man, that punch of yours flies
further and further every day!

122
00:10:16.970 --> 00:10:18.040
Come on!

123
00:10:18.040 --> 00:10:19.940
If you go easy on him,
he'll get a big head!

124
00:10:19.940 --> 00:10:23.640
I got stronger today and I'm
gonna be even stronger tomorrow!

125
00:10:23.640 --> 00:10:25.450
[BOTH]
– Right, Sabo?
– Right, Sabo?

126
00:10:41.460 --> 00:10:45.270
[LUFFY sighs]
Sabo was a nice brother, not like you.

127
00:10:45.270 --> 00:10:48.040
You're trying to say it'd be
better if I'd died, aren't you?

128
00:11:07.830 --> 00:11:10.530
I'm hereby establishing my own country.

129
00:11:10.530 --> 00:11:12.530
He's doing what now?

130
00:11:15.530 --> 00:11:16.730
[DOGRA grunts]

131
00:11:17.840 --> 00:11:19.300
Me, too!

132
00:11:18.860 --> 00:11:19.720
<b>Ace's Country</b>

133
00:11:19.720 --> 00:11:20.560
<b>Luffy's Country</b>

134
00:11:25.210 --> 00:11:27.710
[DADAN]
What're you little idiots up to now?

135
00:11:27.710 --> 00:11:30.110
We need to be strong enough
to live on our own!

136
00:11:30.110 --> 00:11:33.220
You're from the Dadan
Kingdom, by the way.

137
00:11:33.220 --> 00:11:35.690
We still need to use your bath, though.

138
00:11:35.690 --> 00:11:37.390
[LUFFY, ACE]
Hmph!

139
00:11:37.390 --> 00:11:38.820
[DADAN sighs]

140
00:11:39.790 --> 00:11:44.030
[groans, sighs]

141
00:11:46.830 --> 00:11:51.930
- [LUFFY grunting]
- [BEAR growling]

142
00:11:58.110 --> 00:11:59.640
[BEAR snarling]

143
00:11:59.640 --> 00:12:01.310
Ace! This one is way too big.

144
00:12:01.310 --> 00:12:02.810
I need your help!

145
00:12:02.810 --> 00:12:06.780
[ACE]
You? The "Mighty
King Luffy" needs help?

146
00:12:06.780 --> 00:12:09.080
[roars]

147
00:12:09.080 --> 00:12:10.680
Here goes!

148
00:12:10.680 --> 00:12:14.820
[LUFFY grunting]

149
00:12:14.820 --> 00:12:17.090
[gasping]

150
00:12:17.090 --> 00:12:18.960
[LUFFY yells]

151
00:12:20.430 --> 00:12:22.100
No!

152
00:12:23.960 --> 00:12:29.000
[ACE panting]

153
00:12:34.240 --> 00:12:35.610
[ACE]
Hey, Dadan Kingdom!

154
00:12:35.610 --> 00:12:38.120
We need help! Luffy got hurt!

155
00:12:38.120 --> 00:12:39.650
He's in trouble!

156
00:12:41.320 --> 00:12:44.460
Magra! Hurry up! This is bad!

157
00:12:44.460 --> 00:12:47.560
Okay, Ace. Hurry, bring him inside!

158
00:12:49.430 --> 00:12:53.830
[ribbitting]

159
00:12:58.040 --> 00:12:59.450
[ACE sniffling]

160
00:12:59.450 --> 00:13:00.880
Okay, wow.

161
00:13:00.880 --> 00:13:03.180
It's a good thing you brought
him here when you did.

162
00:13:03.180 --> 00:13:07.550
Also, if this cut had been any deeper,
he probably would've died on the spot.

163
00:13:09.720 --> 00:13:12.780
I hate to say it, but this is
no good with only two of you.

164
00:13:12.780 --> 00:13:15.150
[ACE crying]

165
00:13:15.150 --> 00:13:17.720
It's all my fault.

166
00:13:17.720 --> 00:13:18.890
I knew better.

167
00:13:18.890 --> 00:13:24.640
Even if you're a captain, fighting
alone doesn't make you any stronger.

168
00:13:24.640 --> 00:13:27.250
I'm still no good.

169
00:13:27.250 --> 00:13:29.480
I'm still not good enough.

170
00:13:29.480 --> 00:13:33.250
[crying]

171
00:13:33.250 --> 00:13:34.790
Now, now...

172
00:13:34.790 --> 00:13:38.120
[ACE]
I'm sorry, Luffy.

173
00:13:38.120 --> 00:13:40.190
I let you down.

174
00:13:40.190 --> 00:13:43.960
[ACE crying]

175
00:13:48.870 --> 00:13:50.970
[BANDIT C]
Guys, come see!

176
00:13:50.970 --> 00:13:54.310
Makino came to visit
and she brought booze!

177
00:13:55.640 --> 00:13:59.110
[MAKINO]
You want to know how
to properly say "thank you"?

178
00:13:59.110 --> 00:14:00.210
[ACE]
Mm-hm.

179
00:14:00.210 --> 00:14:02.380
[MAKINO]
And what's this
about "paying respects"?

180
00:14:02.380 --> 00:14:04.880
As a pirate and as Luffy's big brother,

181
00:14:04.880 --> 00:14:07.800
I need to pay my respects
to this Shanks guy.

182
00:14:07.800 --> 00:14:11.940
Luffy says he owes the man his life,
so it's kinda the least I can do.

183
00:14:14.790 --> 00:14:16.390
Uh...

184
00:14:16.390 --> 00:14:17.630
[MAKINO gasps]

185
00:14:20.750 --> 00:14:22.860
Got something to say to me?!

186
00:14:22.860 --> 00:14:25.860
[MAKINO chuckles]
Sorry, sorry.

187
00:14:25.860 --> 00:14:28.390
Okay, I think I can give you some tips.

188
00:14:28.390 --> 00:14:30.930
For starters, after a meal...

189
00:14:30.930 --> 00:14:33.020
[CHEF A]
It's a dine and dash!

190
00:14:33.020 --> 00:14:37.290
Come back! [pants]

191
00:14:37.290 --> 00:14:39.360
Wait a sec, we almost forgot!

192
00:14:39.360 --> 00:14:40.630
Gotta pay respect!

193
00:14:40.630 --> 00:14:42.870
Oops! Yeah, you're right!

194
00:14:44.110 --> 00:14:45.880
Huh?

195
00:14:45.880 --> 00:14:48.010
[ACE, LUFFY]
– Thank you for the meal, sir!
– Thank you for the meal, sir!

196
00:14:48.010 --> 00:14:51.550
Ah! Keep your thanks. Are you
brats gonna pay me or what?

197
00:14:51.550 --> 00:14:54.820
[LUFFY yelling]

198
00:14:54.820 --> 00:14:57.860
I'm not losin' today! No way!

199
00:14:57.860 --> 00:15:01.560
[yells, groans]

200
00:15:01.560 --> 00:15:03.560
[ACE grunting]

201
00:15:03.560 --> 00:15:07.000
[LUFFY groaning]

202
00:15:07.000 --> 00:15:10.470
[BEAR snarling]

203
00:15:13.610 --> 00:15:15.830
[BEAR growls]

204
00:15:15.830 --> 00:15:17.100
[ACE, LUFFY grunt]

205
00:15:18.770 --> 00:15:20.870
[ACE grunts]

206
00:15:21.870 --> 00:15:23.340
[LUFFY yelling]

207
00:15:23.340 --> 00:15:25.780
[ACE yelling]

208
00:15:29.410 --> 00:15:30.680
[ACE, LUFFY grunt]

209
00:15:32.420 --> 00:15:34.120
[BOTH]
– All right!
– All right!

210
00:15:34.120 --> 00:15:36.420
[ACE]
Now for some bear meat stew!

211
00:16:35.260 --> 00:16:39.930
<b>Seven years later</b>

212
00:16:41.260 --> 00:16:45.700
<b>Ace, seventeen years old</b>

213
00:16:47.000 --> 00:16:51.840
<b>Luffy, fourteen years old</b>

214
00:17:04.510 --> 00:17:06.370
[LUFFY]
Take care, Ace! See ya!

215
00:17:06.370 --> 00:17:10.950
Yeah. See you soon! Keep training hard!

216
00:17:10.950 --> 00:17:13.180
Just gimme three years
and before you know it,

217
00:17:13.180 --> 00:17:16.950
my wanted poster's gonna
be everywhere you go!

218
00:17:16.950 --> 00:17:19.350
[ACE laughing]

219
00:17:22.320 --> 00:17:25.560
Kick some ass! Bon voyage!

220
00:17:26.890 --> 00:17:29.160
Don't catch a cold out there!

221
00:17:29.160 --> 00:17:32.470
Look for me in the papers.
It won't take long, okay?

222
00:17:34.400 --> 00:17:38.810
[NARRATOR]
The world did not know that the son
of Gold Roger had grown up in secret,

223
00:17:38.810 --> 00:17:44.080
nor did they know that he set sail that day,
determined to make a name of his own.

224
00:17:47.720 --> 00:17:49.720
[ACE chuckles]

225
00:17:57.440 --> 00:18:01.110
[LUFFY laughs]
Guess that's it, huh?

226
00:18:02.300 --> 00:18:06.330
Honestly! If Garp were here,
think of what he'd say.

227
00:18:24.010 --> 00:18:26.270
[GARP]
Gonna need you
to raise this baby for me!

228
00:18:26.270 --> 00:18:29.100
[DADAN]
What? Why? Is it even yours?

229
00:18:30.270 --> 00:18:32.110
So there you are, Boss!

230
00:18:32.110 --> 00:18:36.210
Hey! Believe it or not, Ace is gone!

231
00:18:36.210 --> 00:18:37.180
[DADAN]
That so?

232
00:18:37.180 --> 00:18:41.650
Well, one less brat to worry about,
though I'm sure Garp'll gimme hell for it.

233
00:18:41.650 --> 00:18:44.410
Kid left and he's still
causin' me trouble.

234
00:18:44.410 --> 00:18:48.220
Oh, I almost forgot, there's
a message he asked us to give to you.

235
00:18:48.220 --> 00:18:49.850
[DADAN]
Yeah, why should I care?

236
00:18:49.850 --> 00:18:53.420
He probably just wants to tell
me my feet smell or somethin'.

237
00:18:53.420 --> 00:18:56.120
[BANDIT A]
He said, "thank
you for taking care of me."

238
00:18:56.120 --> 00:19:01.150
[gasps, crying]

239
00:19:01.150 --> 00:19:04.420
How could you do that to me, you beast?

240
00:19:05.890 --> 00:19:06.820
[BANDIT A]
What's wrong, Boss?

241
00:19:06.820 --> 00:19:08.260
You're not crying, are you?

242
00:19:08.260 --> 00:19:11.320
[DADAN]
If you don't
shut up, I'll make you cry!

243
00:19:23.560 --> 00:19:26.400
Three more years, that's the rule.

244
00:19:26.400 --> 00:19:28.140
Now, Gum-Gum...

245
00:19:28.140 --> 00:19:30.200
Pistol!

246
00:19:30.200 --> 00:19:31.470
[gasps]

247
00:19:32.740 --> 00:19:36.410
So close! I just need a little more.

248
00:19:38.110 --> 00:19:40.280
You almost got it now, Luffy.

249
00:19:40.280 --> 00:19:43.450
Bend your legs a little
and aim straight ahead!

250
00:19:43.450 --> 00:19:44.520
[LUFFY]
Heh.

251
00:19:46.920 --> 00:19:50.420
Now, Gum-Gum... Pistol!

252
00:19:50.420 --> 00:19:51.820
[LUFFY grunts]

253
00:19:55.160 --> 00:19:57.290
[LUFFY chuckles]

254
00:19:57.290 --> 00:19:59.230
[SABO chuckles]

255
00:20:00.860 --> 00:20:02.230
[LUFFY grunts]

256
00:20:03.630 --> 00:20:05.870
Gotta keep getting stronger!

257
00:20:05.870 --> 00:20:09.810
Hang on, Ace! I'm comin' for you!

258
00:20:09.270 --> 00:20:11.520
<b>Several months later...</b>

259
00:20:17.260 --> 00:20:18.060
[DOGRA]
Luffy!

260
00:20:18.060 --> 00:20:19.000
[LUFFY]
Hm?

261
00:20:19.000 --> 00:20:21.030
[DOGRA]
You gotta see the paper! Look!

262
00:20:21.030 --> 00:20:21.830
Oh? What's up?

263
00:20:21.830 --> 00:20:24.270
[DOGRA]
It's just like he said!

264
00:20:24.270 --> 00:20:26.970
[LUFFY]
Whoa, you're right! Ace made the news!

265
00:20:26.970 --> 00:20:29.210
He's got a ship and
a crew and everything!

266
00:20:29.210 --> 00:20:32.310
Aw, man. I'm so jealous! Wow!

267
00:20:32.310 --> 00:20:34.510
[LUFFY chuckles]

268
00:20:34.510 --> 00:20:36.880
[LUFFY]
But I'm gonna do even better!

269
00:20:40.740 --> 00:20:44.720
<b>Three years later... Luffy, seventeen years old</b>

270
00:20:45.110 --> 00:20:47.050
Hey, you guys!

271
00:20:47.050 --> 00:20:51.520
I'm leaving now! You're not
gonna see me off? Hey!

272
00:20:51.520 --> 00:20:53.260
[DADAN]
Use your head for once.

273
00:20:53.260 --> 00:20:55.760
The mayor and Makino
wouldn't mind us stopping by,

274
00:20:55.760 --> 00:20:58.160
but as for everyone else
in Windmill Village?

275
00:20:58.160 --> 00:21:00.370
We'd probably scare
the pants right off 'em.

276
00:21:00.370 --> 00:21:01.570
I dunno...

277
00:21:01.570 --> 00:21:04.740
Ugh, don't make it
awkward, just go already!

278
00:21:04.740 --> 00:21:07.480
Okay, well, goodbye, you guys.

279
00:21:07.480 --> 00:21:10.050
Thanks for everything.
I'm sure gonna miss you!

280
00:21:10.050 --> 00:21:12.990
[BANDITS]
Aw, now don't say that,
you're gonna make us blush!

281
00:21:12.990 --> 00:21:15.030
Well, bye. Take it easy!

282
00:21:15.030 --> 00:21:18.370
Heh. I will! You guys, too, okay?

283
00:21:19.520 --> 00:21:20.700
Oh! One last thing!

284
00:21:20.700 --> 00:21:21.900
[BANDITS]
Huh?

285
00:21:21.900 --> 00:21:24.370
Dadan, I still think mountain
bandits are super lame!

286
00:21:24.370 --> 00:21:26.370
[DADAN]
Shut up and leave, damn it!

287
00:21:27.400 --> 00:21:29.930
But you guys, you're great!

288
00:21:29.930 --> 00:21:33.300
[gasps, crying]

289
00:21:33.300 --> 00:21:37.780
It's not enough to ruin my life,
now you gotta break my heart, too?

290
00:21:37.780 --> 00:21:39.200
You're awful, I tell ya!

291
00:21:39.200 --> 00:21:42.130
All of you are good
for nothin'! [cries]

292
00:21:42.130 --> 00:21:43.930
[LUFFY]
Sorry I made you cry.

293
00:21:43.930 --> 00:21:46.530
[DADAN]
Shut up or I'll make you cry!

294
00:21:48.550 --> 00:21:51.330
[NARRATOR]
Now, to Windmill Village on Dawn Island

295
00:21:51.330 --> 00:21:52.860
at the edge of the Goa Kingdom.

296
00:21:52.860 --> 00:21:57.330
[MAN B]
No offense, but why don't you take
my old fishing boat instead, Luffy?

297
00:21:57.330 --> 00:21:59.900
That thing is gonna sink as
soon as you get out to sea!

298
00:21:59.900 --> 00:22:02.470
That's too small, even for you!

299
00:22:02.470 --> 00:22:06.740
I wanna start small, but I'll get
a real big one soon, don't worry!

300
00:22:06.740 --> 00:22:08.940
[laughs]

301
00:22:10.280 --> 00:22:12.990
[LUFFY]
Sabo!

302
00:22:12.990 --> 00:22:15.030
Here I go!

303
00:22:15.030 --> 00:22:18.830
Watch out for me
out there, okay? [laughs]

304
00:22:20.360 --> 00:22:23.500
[LUFFY]
Sabo was first and Ace was second.

305
00:22:24.470 --> 00:22:27.260
I may be the last to go,
but I'm gonna be the best!

306
00:22:27.260 --> 00:22:29.030
I'm comin' for you, Ace!

307
00:22:29.030 --> 00:22:31.770
And all my special moves work now, too!

308
00:22:31.770 --> 00:22:33.240
Why are you talking to yourself?

309
00:22:33.240 --> 00:22:36.470
Is this some kind of
pirate ritual I don't get?

310
00:22:36.470 --> 00:22:37.940
No, it's a challenge!

311
00:22:37.940 --> 00:22:39.510
To my brother, Ace!

312
00:22:39.510 --> 00:22:40.910
Ace? Who is that?

313
00:22:40.910 --> 00:22:42.240
[MAN E]
I dunno.

314
00:22:42.240 --> 00:22:44.980
Okay! I'm goin' for real now!

315
00:22:49.380 --> 00:22:53.680
[CROWD shouting]

316
00:22:53.680 --> 00:22:56.720
I knew this day would come,
but I'm still a bit sad.

317
00:22:56.720 --> 00:22:58.660
I'll sure miss him.

318
00:22:58.660 --> 00:23:02.160
Sad is right, like the
world needs another pirate!

319
00:23:04.680 --> 00:23:06.240
[sighs]

320
00:23:06.240 --> 00:23:09.410
[LUFFY]
Perfect weather today! Lucky me!

321
00:23:13.750 --> 00:23:15.860
[LUFFY chuckles]

322
00:23:15.860 --> 00:23:18.330
[gasping]

323
00:23:20.730 --> 00:23:21.930
[CROWD gasping]

324
00:23:21.930 --> 00:23:23.270
Oh, no!

325
00:23:27.370 --> 00:23:30.540
Hey, pal. It's been a while, huh?

326
00:23:35.310 --> 00:23:37.780
This won't play out like last time.

327
00:23:37.780 --> 00:23:42.250
I've been practicing this
move for ten whole years!

328
00:23:42.250 --> 00:23:44.750
Now, Gum-Gum...

329
00:23:48.330 --> 00:23:50.400
[roars]

330
00:23:50.400 --> 00:23:53.070
...Pistol!

331
00:24:00.100 --> 00:24:04.340
[SEA MONSTER groans]

332
00:24:07.980 --> 00:24:09.310
Heh.

333
00:24:09.310 --> 00:24:11.210
Been waitin' a long time to do that.

334
00:24:11.210 --> 00:24:17.790
[CROWD cheering]

335
00:24:17.790 --> 00:24:19.020
[MAGRA, DADAN gasp]

336
00:24:19.020 --> 00:24:22.760
He just... took out that
sea monster in one punch!

337
00:24:24.330 --> 00:24:27.160
I gotta admit... I'm proud.

338
00:24:28.300 --> 00:24:30.530
[LUFFY]
First, I need a crew.

339
00:24:30.530 --> 00:24:33.640
About ten people should be enough.

340
00:24:33.640 --> 00:24:36.810
After that, pirate flag!

341
00:24:36.810 --> 00:24:40.640
All right! Let's get going!

342
00:24:42.240 --> 00:24:44.350
Someday I'm gonna be...

343
00:24:45.980 --> 00:24:49.320
[LUFFY]
...King of the Pirates!

344
00:24:58.360 --> 00:25:03.560
[NARRATOR]
But time has not been kind,
and after the death of Ace,

345
00:25:03.560 --> 00:25:07.900
Luffy's optimism from that
day is nowhere in sight.

346
00:25:07.900 --> 00:25:12.940
[LUFFY crying]

347
00:25:21.080 --> 00:25:22.990
Please, Luffy...

348
00:25:23.410 --> 00:25:26.000
the King of the Pirates someday, too!

349
00:25:26.000 --> 00:25:28.400
I'm so...

350
00:25:28.400 --> 00:25:31.390
I'm so weak!

351
00:25:31.290 --> 00:25:35.880
<b>East Blue - Goa Kingdom - Windmill Village</b>

352
00:25:31.390 --> 00:25:32.860
[BANDIT A]
It's Garp!

353
00:25:32.860 --> 00:25:34.930
[BANDIT B]
Garp is back and
he brought his battleship!

354
00:25:34.930 --> 00:25:36.490
[BANDIT C]
Should we run?

355
00:25:36.490 --> 00:25:39.050
[MAN H]
I read about the battle
at Marineford in the paper!

356
00:25:39.050 --> 00:25:41.320
Congratulations on your victory!

357
00:25:41.320 --> 00:25:43.490
[GARP]
Word travels fast these days, huh?

358
00:25:43.490 --> 00:25:45.050
[MAN I]
Is Luffy okay?

359
00:25:45.050 --> 00:25:48.120
Now that Whitebeard's dead,
the pirates are going out of control.

360
00:25:48.120 --> 00:25:49.720
Is that why you're here?

361
00:25:49.720 --> 00:25:51.060
Things have gotten bad.

362
00:25:51.060 --> 00:25:55.370
We're afraid to go out. They're
like vultures staring us down.

363
00:25:55.370 --> 00:25:59.170
I don't mean to complain, but I'm
afraid they could invade any second now.

364
00:25:59.170 --> 00:26:00.500
Not likely!

365
00:26:00.500 --> 00:26:04.270
I just sunk three of 'em with
cannonballs on the way out here.

366
00:26:04.270 --> 00:26:06.090
Really? Whew!

367
00:26:06.090 --> 00:26:08.930
[GARP]
Eh, they we're nothing
but a bunch of blowhards.

368
00:26:08.930 --> 00:26:10.780
All bark and no bite.

369
00:26:10.780 --> 00:26:12.950
But seas are gonna be
tense the world over

370
00:26:12.950 --> 00:26:15.520
without Whitebeard
to scare off all the thugs.

371
00:26:15.520 --> 00:26:18.690
Even if that's not
the Navy's "official" stance.

372
00:26:18.690 --> 00:26:23.030
Anyway, since you're so far from our
base, I prepared a little something.

373
00:26:23.030 --> 00:26:23.730
See?

374
00:26:23.730 --> 00:26:24.700
[MARINES]
– Sir!
– Sir!

375
00:26:26.290 --> 00:26:28.930
[MAN J]
"Security by Navy Vice Admiral Garp"?

376
00:26:28.930 --> 00:26:30.660
That'll scare 'em off for sure!

377
00:26:30.660 --> 00:26:34.130
[WOMAN A]
One look at that
and they'll straighten right up!

378
00:26:34.130 --> 00:26:36.900
While you're here,
there's one more problem.

379
00:26:36.900 --> 00:26:39.100
A bunch of mountain bandits
came down to the village.

380
00:26:39.100 --> 00:26:42.090
They took over Makino's bar
and they aren't leaving.

381
00:26:42.090 --> 00:26:43.460
[GARP]
That so?

382
00:26:43.460 --> 00:26:46.060
[MAKINO]
Please! Calm down!

383
00:26:50.160 --> 00:26:51.320
[DADAN]
Hello, Garp!

384
00:26:51.320 --> 00:26:53.160
Hey, that's one right there!

385
00:26:54.690 --> 00:26:59.100
[DADAN]
How dare you show your face
here after what you've done!

386
00:26:59.100 --> 00:26:59.800
[MARINES, CROWD gasp]

387
00:26:59.800 --> 00:27:01.100
[MAN K]
Garp!

388
00:27:01.100 --> 00:27:02.840
That's not good!

389
00:27:02.840 --> 00:27:03.700
[MARINES]
– Vice Admiral!
– Vice Admiral!

390
00:27:03.700 --> 00:27:08.710
[panting]

391
00:27:10.840 --> 00:27:13.450
Back off, men. She's a friend.

392
00:27:13.450 --> 00:27:14.580
[MARINES]
– Huh?
– Huh?

393
00:27:14.580 --> 00:27:16.480
[DADAN panting]

394
00:27:16.480 --> 00:27:19.010
[DADAN]
The hell I am!

395
00:27:19.010 --> 00:27:22.280
You were right with
them on that battlefield!

396
00:27:22.280 --> 00:27:26.190
Those poor boys and you didn't
do a damn thing to help them!

397
00:27:26.190 --> 00:27:28.520
Why did you have me raise Ace? Huh?

398
00:27:28.520 --> 00:27:34.190
Why did you have me take care of them
if it was going to end this way?

399
00:27:37.280 --> 00:27:38.480
[gasps]

400
00:27:38.480 --> 00:27:41.320
[grunts]

401
00:27:41.320 --> 00:27:44.960
You stood there and
watched that boy die!

402
00:27:44.960 --> 00:27:48.590
You care more about your
damn job than your family!

403
00:27:48.590 --> 00:27:50.160
"The great hero of the Navy"!

404
00:27:50.160 --> 00:27:53.640
I hope you're proud of yourself,
you heartless piece of crap!

405
00:27:53.640 --> 00:27:57.380
[MAGRA]
Now, now, Boss. Take it easy!

406
00:27:57.380 --> 00:27:59.350
[DADAN]
Say something, you bastard!

407
00:27:59.350 --> 00:28:00.380
Why didn't you help him?

408
00:28:00.380 --> 00:28:03.550
Why didn't you do something?

409
00:28:03.550 --> 00:28:05.320
Look me right in the face!

410
00:28:05.320 --> 00:28:07.060
You spineless wretch!

411
00:28:07.060 --> 00:28:09.420
You answer me, dammit!

412
00:28:09.420 --> 00:28:11.230
Dadan! Enough!

413
00:28:14.340 --> 00:28:16.240
[MAKINO]
Mm-mm.

414
00:28:17.510 --> 00:28:19.250
Makino...

415
00:28:22.320 --> 00:28:25.390
[panting]

416
00:28:31.430 --> 00:28:37.200
[DADAN panting]

417
00:28:37.200 --> 00:28:38.730
How do you think he feels?

418
00:28:38.730 --> 00:28:41.470
He's their grandfather.
He's suffering, too!

419
00:28:41.470 --> 00:28:44.540
He was right there and
he couldn't do a thing!

420
00:28:54.520 --> 00:28:56.450
You're wrong.

421
00:28:57.820 --> 00:28:59.790
[DADAN]
"Garp is suffering"?

422
00:29:00.890 --> 00:29:02.490
No.

423
00:29:03.690 --> 00:29:07.560
[DADAN]
The only one who's really
suffering here is Luffy, damn it.

424
00:29:17.500 --> 00:29:20.570
'Kay, so let's pretend Shanks
is here with you right now.

425
00:29:20.570 --> 00:29:22.100
What do you say?

426
00:29:22.100 --> 00:29:25.440
[ACE]
Hi. I'm Ace. Who the hell are you?

427
00:29:25.440 --> 00:29:26.290
Boo!

428
00:29:26.290 --> 00:29:28.700
I know you're pirates, but I
don't think he'd be impressed.

429
00:29:29.410 --> 00:29:31.780
Yeah! Be way more cool!

430
00:29:33.180 --> 00:29:34.990
Fancy meeting you here.

431
00:29:34.990 --> 00:29:36.290
Boo!

432
00:29:36.290 --> 00:29:38.430
Mister? What's your deal?

433
00:29:38.430 --> 00:29:40.500
[MAKINO]
Boo!

434
00:29:40.500 --> 00:29:42.300
'Cause he didn't say "punk"?

435
00:29:42.300 --> 00:29:43.470
[MAKINO]
Nope! Nope!

436
00:29:44.490 --> 00:29:47.690
[laughs]
Luffy, stop!
You're distracting poor Ace!

437
00:29:47.690 --> 00:29:50.490
Go be stupid somewhere else.
We're learning here!

438
00:29:50.490 --> 00:29:51.730
You little pest!

439
00:29:51.730 --> 00:29:53.290
I'm not distracting!

440
00:29:53.290 --> 00:29:54.430
Oh, yeah!

441
00:29:54.430 --> 00:29:58.390
I found an anaconda nest filled with
a bunch of eggs and they're super huge!

442
00:29:58.390 --> 00:30:00.190
Let's grab 'em and cook 'em up!

443
00:30:00.190 --> 00:30:02.400
What? Man, that sounds awesome!

444
00:30:02.400 --> 00:30:04.120
No, not right now.

445
00:30:04.120 --> 00:30:05.560
Aww...

446
00:30:05.560 --> 00:30:07.490
[ACE]
I'm gonna learn some
manners even if it kills me!

447
00:30:07.490 --> 00:30:09.020
[LUFFY]
I can't go on my own!

448
00:30:09.020 --> 00:30:11.490
What if the anaconda mom finds me?

449
00:30:11.490 --> 00:30:14.060
But if you're there with me,
we can beat it for sure!

450
00:30:14.060 --> 00:30:14.830
C'mon, let's go!

451
00:30:14.830 --> 00:30:16.560
[ACE]
I said no!

452
00:30:18.770 --> 00:30:22.500
Luffy loved Ace more than
anything in the world.

453
00:30:27.720 --> 00:30:32.020
[MAKINO crying]

454
00:30:32.020 --> 00:30:33.020
Makino!

455
00:30:36.290 --> 00:30:38.160
[MAYOR]
Hey, Garp.

456
00:30:38.160 --> 00:30:39.330
What happened to Luffy?

457
00:30:39.330 --> 00:30:42.660
The newspaper said he
went missing after the war.

458
00:30:42.660 --> 00:30:44.530
That he did.

459
00:30:50.370 --> 00:30:52.440
A submarine carried him away.

460
00:30:53.970 --> 00:30:57.070
The Admirals attacked and tried
to stop him from escaping,

461
00:30:57.070 --> 00:31:02.840
and afterwards, they held a search,
but they couldn't find a single trace of him.

462
00:31:02.840 --> 00:31:06.510
There was no shipwreck,
so he's probably alive.

463
00:31:06.510 --> 00:31:07.440
[CROWD sighs]

464
00:31:07.440 --> 00:31:08.710
That's a relief!

465
00:31:08.710 --> 00:31:10.780
Wait, so what's up with this bandit?

466
00:31:10.780 --> 00:31:15.120
She obviously seems to know Garp,
but why did he let her punch him like that?

467
00:31:15.120 --> 00:31:16.290
Yeah.

468
00:31:21.640 --> 00:31:25.110
[DADAN]
Luffy's been a little
moron since the day I met him,

469
00:31:25.110 --> 00:31:28.610
but no matter what he does,
I'm always on his side.

470
00:31:31.250 --> 00:31:36.650
[DADAN]
As much as I'm hurting, I know he's
got it worse, and it breaks my heart.

471
00:31:44.640 --> 00:31:47.510
[DADAN]
Luffy!

472
00:31:47.510 --> 00:31:53.380
I know things are hard right now,
but don't you dare give up!

473
00:31:57.880 --> 00:32:04.420
[NARRATOR]
Meanwhile, far away and far along the Grand
Line in a place known as the New World.

474
00:32:33.230 --> 00:32:35.660
I don't know how I can
ever thank you enough.

475
00:32:37.400 --> 00:32:40.000
No need to make a big deal out of it.

476
00:32:40.000 --> 00:32:44.440
Whitebeard was a rival, but I still
held a lot of respect for the man.

477
00:32:49.220 --> 00:32:52.850
Well, I suppose it's time for us to go.

478
00:32:52.850 --> 00:32:54.820
Yeah, thank you again.

479
00:32:56.120 --> 00:32:59.860
[SHANKS]
I can only imagine
how tough this is on Luffy.

480
00:32:59.860 --> 00:33:04.000
Even so, his brother
died like a true man.

481
00:33:05.030 --> 00:33:07.700
Take it back or else.

482
00:33:07.700 --> 00:33:11.630
You don't know anything about
the man who saved my life!

483
00:33:11.630 --> 00:33:15.000
This is his era. Don't you forget it!

484
00:33:20.140 --> 00:33:22.870
[SHANKS]
Maybe Ace wouldn't want to hear this,

485
00:33:22.870 --> 00:33:25.940
but that's exactly what
Captain Roger would've done.

486
00:33:27.640 --> 00:33:31.850
[SHANKS]
There were times when I wished
he wasn't too bold to run away...

487
00:33:34.020 --> 00:33:36.190
[SHANKS]
Too bold to shed tears.

488
00:33:40.880 --> 00:33:43.140
[SHANKS]
Listen, Luffy.

489
00:33:43.140 --> 00:33:48.180
It's not only victory that
makes a man, but defeat.

490
00:33:48.180 --> 00:33:50.950
Joy and sorrow alike.

491
00:33:50.950 --> 00:33:53.360
There's no shame in backing down.

492
00:34:03.400 --> 00:34:05.530
[SHANKS]
There's no shame in crying...

493
00:34:08.000 --> 00:34:10.340
[SHANKS]
...so long as you overcome it.

494
00:34:16.380 --> 00:34:20.420
<b>"Calm Belt" - Island of Women</b>

495
00:34:37.380 --> 00:34:38.520
[JIMBEI]
I cannot.

496
00:34:38.520 --> 00:34:43.020
Although I understand your pain, I will
not allow you to hurt yourself any more.

497
00:34:44.360 --> 00:34:46.060
It's not your business!

498
00:34:46.060 --> 00:34:47.760
This is my body!

499
00:34:47.760 --> 00:34:49.230
[JIMBEI]
What of Ace, then?

500
00:34:49.230 --> 00:34:51.960
Who sacrificed his body to protect you?

501
00:34:51.960 --> 00:34:54.100
Was that none of your business?

502
00:34:54.100 --> 00:34:56.000
You bastard. Shut up!

503
00:34:56.000 --> 00:34:59.230
Say one more word and
I'm gonna crush you!

504
00:34:59.230 --> 00:35:02.260
If that would make you happy,
then why don't you try?

505
00:35:02.260 --> 00:35:06.430
But let me warn you, injured though
I am, you will not defeat me.

506
00:35:06.430 --> 00:35:08.100
Not in that condition!

507
00:35:08.100 --> 00:35:11.140
Gum-Gum... Pistol!

508
00:35:12.240 --> 00:35:15.040
[JIMBEI growls]

509
00:35:20.110 --> 00:35:28.200
[panting]

510
00:35:32.400 --> 00:35:35.100
[panting]

511
00:35:36.640 --> 00:35:39.310
[ACE]
Let me tell you something.

512
00:35:39.310 --> 00:35:45.580
A while back, when I was hunting down
Teach, I went to Alabasta Kingdom

513
00:35:45.580 --> 00:35:50.120
and I saw my brother for the
first time in three years.

514
00:35:50.120 --> 00:35:54.220
As soon as I saw his face,
a weight lifted from my heart.

515
00:35:55.560 --> 00:35:57.230
And do you know why?

516
00:36:01.880 --> 00:36:02.920
[yells]

517
00:36:02.920 --> 00:36:04.850
Ow! Are you insane?

518
00:36:04.850 --> 00:36:06.420
Stop! Luffy!

519
00:36:07.820 --> 00:36:09.520
I've had enough of your nonsense!

520
00:36:09.520 --> 00:36:12.190
[LUFFY yells]

521
00:36:12.190 --> 00:36:13.360
[JIMBEI grunts]

522
00:36:16.100 --> 00:36:19.900
Boy, you can't see
a thing. You're blind.

523
00:36:19.900 --> 00:36:24.370
You never doubted your strength,
but now the confidence that once allowed you

524
00:36:24.370 --> 00:36:27.240
to soar above the clouds
has been shattered.

525
00:36:27.240 --> 00:36:29.280
Your brother, who was
your guiding light,

526
00:36:29.280 --> 00:36:32.920
has faded away,
and your enemies stand so tall

527
00:36:32.920 --> 00:36:37.750
and cast so great a shadow, that you
can do naught but cower in the darkness.

528
00:36:37.750 --> 00:36:43.060
And now, you strike out like an animal at
the cage your doubt has placed around you.

529
00:36:45.300 --> 00:36:48.140
[JIMBEI]
So long as you are
consumed by regret and guilt,

530
00:36:48.140 --> 00:36:51.680
you will never find your way forward!

531
00:36:51.680 --> 00:36:57.320
Luffy, your pain may be great,
but it mustn't devour you!

532
00:36:57.320 --> 00:37:00.220
There is yet joy beyond your sorrows!

533
00:37:00.220 --> 00:37:02.390
What's gone may be gone,

534
00:37:02.390 --> 00:37:05.190
but you still have something
left in this world to treasure.

535
00:37:05.190 --> 00:37:06.730
Don't you?!

536
00:37:50.030 --> 00:37:54.430
[ZORO grunting]

537
00:37:54.430 --> 00:37:56.240
Hey, you wanna screw around?

538
00:37:56.240 --> 00:37:57.640
Go do it somewhere else.

539
00:37:57.640 --> 00:37:59.910
I'm tryin' to build muscle here!

540
00:38:04.580 --> 00:38:07.780
Luffy! We've got a big
storm on the horizon!

541
00:38:07.780 --> 00:38:09.580
Make preparations, quick!

542
00:38:11.380 --> 00:38:13.750
[USOPP]
I had a big one! You just missed it!

543
00:38:13.750 --> 00:38:16.760
But the next one is
gonna be even bigger!

544
00:38:19.760 --> 00:38:20.830
Scram!

545
00:38:20.830 --> 00:38:24.360
I'm almost done!
Just keep your pants on!

546
00:38:24.360 --> 00:38:28.330
It's okay. No matter how bad
you're hurt, you're in good hands!

547
00:38:28.330 --> 00:38:31.230
By the way, this one
might sting a little bit.

548
00:38:35.330 --> 00:38:37.300
Oh, Luffy!

549
00:38:37.300 --> 00:38:40.140
If you like treasure,
this research is fascinating!

550
00:38:40.140 --> 00:38:41.340
Come see!

551
00:38:44.210 --> 00:38:45.280
What's up, buddy?

552
00:38:45.280 --> 00:38:48.500
If you're checkin' on the cola
engine, it's in super shape.

553
00:38:48.500 --> 00:38:49.770
Wow!

554
00:38:49.770 --> 00:38:53.070
And if you're checkin' on
me, well, I'm super, too!

555
00:38:53.070 --> 00:38:54.240
[BROOK]
Good morning, Captain!

556
00:38:54.240 --> 00:38:55.670
Rise and shine!

557
00:38:55.670 --> 00:38:57.810
How about I play you a little song?

558
00:38:57.810 --> 00:38:59.710
Really get those bones moving!

559
00:38:59.710 --> 00:39:01.480
[BROOK laughs]

560
00:39:08.430 --> 00:39:10.080
Luffy.

561
00:39:10.080 --> 00:39:12.580
Luffy!

562
00:39:12.580 --> 00:39:13.610
Luffy.

563
00:39:13.610 --> 00:39:15.680
Luffy!

564
00:39:16.980 --> 00:39:18.420
Luffy.

565
00:39:18.420 --> 00:39:20.390
Luffy!

566
00:39:20.390 --> 00:39:22.410
Captain Luffy!

567
00:39:22.410 --> 00:39:24.380
[ALL]
– Luffy!
– Luffy!

568
00:39:26.280 --> 00:39:30.230
[LUFFY crying]

569
00:39:30.230 --> 00:39:31.730
[JIMBEI]
Hmm?

570
00:39:36.110 --> 00:39:38.340
My crew...

571
00:39:38.340 --> 00:39:40.490
I still have my crew!

572
00:39:40.490 --> 00:39:45.530
Zoro, Nami, Usopp,
Sanji, Chopper, Robin,

573
00:39:45.530 --> 00:39:47.800
Franky, and Brook!

574
00:39:47.800 --> 00:39:51.330
They're still out there,
waiting for me!

575
00:39:51.330 --> 00:39:54.910
[sighs]
Now do you see?

576
00:39:54.910 --> 00:39:58.710
[LUFFY]
I have to get back to the ship
no matter how long it takes me.

577
00:39:58.710 --> 00:40:02.580
Guys! Meet back on
the Sunny in three days!

578
00:40:02.580 --> 00:40:03.780
[ALL]
– Roger!
– Roger!

579
00:40:05.150 --> 00:40:11.390
[LUFFY]
Everything's a mess and I'm already late,
but I have to make it back to Sabaody.

580
00:40:11.390 --> 00:40:13.800
I know they'll be there.

581
00:40:13.800 --> 00:40:18.840
[ACE]
It wasn't just knowing he was safe,
or seeing him smile again...

582
00:40:21.270 --> 00:40:23.670
When you've got a bungling
kid brother like me...

583
00:40:25.040 --> 00:40:27.940
ya can't help but worry a bit.

584
00:40:27.940 --> 00:40:33.320
He might be a bit much for all of you
to handle, but take good care of him for me.

585
00:40:34.680 --> 00:40:37.350
[ACE]
I mean, sure,
he wasn't the snot-nosed kid

586
00:40:37.350 --> 00:40:41.360
following me around anymore,
but more than that...

587
00:40:41.360 --> 00:40:42.890
He had friends...

588
00:40:45.690 --> 00:40:48.360
A crew that he could depend on.

589
00:40:50.560 --> 00:40:56.930
No matter what, he'll be just fine,
so I don't have to worry anymore.

590
00:41:00.570 --> 00:41:03.240
[LUFFY]
I wish they were here right now.

591
00:41:03.240 --> 00:41:04.570
I miss them.

592
00:41:04.570 --> 00:41:06.530
I miss my crew!
